{"title":"The Radavist Podcast Ep 08: Nicolette Jones on Riding, Hiking, and Skiing the Colorado Trail","link":"https://theradavist.com/the-radavist-podcast-ep-08-nicolette-jones-on-riding-hiking-and-skiing-the-colorado-trail","date":1790834460000,"content":"<p><em>Nicolette Jones’s experience with the Colorado Trail doesn’t stop at the bike—she’s skied it and thru-hiked it too. <span></span></em></p>\n<p>Racing the CTR this past summer marked <a href=\"https://walkskicycle.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Nicolette Jones</a>‘s sixth trip down the Colorado Trail—and she still thinks that biking is the easiest method of travel after also thru-hiking and skiing it.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/ccfd9a91770279019e42c572d06409782f2593657939f7bb25f2506648f6c227.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/b9e7816f89e5ac5a76e3d872fe9b0942f98543f68874af2c9badd81d664d2e61.jpg 800w, /media/ccfd9a91770279019e42c572d06409782f2593657939f7bb25f2506648f6c227.jpg 1600w, /media/f79ccbeea322acb551ed17f1b26de83ac871ae1ecb9fc6f20c939eda1eaf29e3.jpg\" width=\"1067\" height=\"800\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/f5e79e060e1b77008415b35e4b32291c4b8f55d92cb50b82d7055a05dbcc35b0.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/5bd3567d8a075ff6c75317c29f635443881753ea720976b2125e56bc213b19da.jpg 800w, /media/f5e79e060e1b77008415b35e4b32291c4b8f55d92cb50b82d7055a05dbcc35b0.jpg 1600w, /media/127be7997a48057cfa21f1407196245dd336f97887617d527f1110031d9cc1e2.jpg\" width=\"1067\" height=\"800\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/5f4e9f29084ab00be4465ad67160d73ec9abe9047a7c687255cf615151a58a4f.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/ce21bcc3cc4ddf6e78d7804614dbf71d90a18129051b39ede03b675e329bc82b.jpg 800w, /media/5f4e9f29084ab00be4465ad67160d73ec9abe9047a7c687255cf615151a58a4f.jpg 1600w, /media/73d0ff82df1bc3f2f6cf6d6fefa1121c2cf9e123b43e7fb32540855aaf63a9d3.jpg\" width=\"1067\" height=\"800\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/0b131b23e388fdcb80e333e3a8fa89bff17919500392a850e65c935063f9bb74.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/2ac47e2c0500f4e5fe60c2303802082d3225a153bf260945228b2e4ecb45d430.jpg 800w, /media/a206641d34953d22585744aa1827da7d311e01092aef2f19994879ca8feac70c.jpg 1600w, /media/0b131b23e388fdcb80e333e3a8fa89bff17919500392a850e65c935063f9bb74.jpg\" width=\"746\" height=\"800\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/2fc7fd671f86949f16ff9ff772cc93f039fe0930c8143bbbe4f5dbb1a5a0b505.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/5f4703ae72c9ff99aa970d71cb52b517f75fd06ae2957934f67c75e2753cc2b4.jpg 800w, /media/ea86ae925b3bc166c7314ea215be8c5b27ec882f96b638e349b29e7113997c15.jpg 1600w, /media/2fc7fd671f86949f16ff9ff772cc93f039fe0930c8143bbbe4f5dbb1a5a0b505.jpg\" width=\"1063\" height=\"800\" /></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Tune into the latest episode of the podcast for a conversation heavy on the CT, where Nic talks about how she structures her life to pursue competition in bikepacking, her choice to be (mostly) off social media, and why she thinks more people should ride tandems.</p>\n<p>Listen to The Radavist Podcast on <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/6X6Pd3oe4UjnecqCUJRViS?si=16ba7c60c13d407e\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify</a>, <a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-radavist-podcast/id1874030722\" target=\"_blank\">Apple Podcasts</a>, or <a href=\"https://music.amazon.com/podcasts/6a905a23-4f9d-4b69-86e5-6452fa217073/the-radavist-podcast\" target=\"_blank\">Amazon Music</a>. You can also use an <a href=\"https://api.riverside.fm/hosting/sKjhmj6O.rss\" target=\"_blank\">RSS feed</a>.</p>\n<p>And please, if you like the content we produce over here, please sign up to support us via <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/membership/join\" target=\"_blank\">The Radavist Membership</a>.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/the-radavist-podcast-ep-08-nicolette-jones-on-riding-hiking-and-skiing-the-colorado-trail\">The Radavist Podcast Ep 08: Nicolette Jones on Riding, Hiking, and Skiing the Colorado Trail</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://cms.theradavist.com/\">The Radavist</a>.</p>","author":"Hailey Moore","